{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":210899,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2025,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8obMQxVbBV9HtCYd9WIyG6oS1IX.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"5744411","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ついにCDデビューし、「新人メンズアイドルフェス」でも優勝を果たしたPROTOSTAR。 ある日、明良たちが知らない間にsMiLeaプロダクション所属のPROTOSTAR、LEGIT、JAXX/JAXXでリリースバトルを行うことが事務所から発表されていた。 リリースバトルがどんな内容なのかもわからない中、アイドルが楽しいからワクワクすると話している明良に対し、親友のかっちゃんは何やら思いつめているようで……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1mTB8EMnU2tMnmPSTKlKVZ14MS3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1mTB8EMnU2tMnmPSTKlKVZ14MS3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/1"},{"id":"5893300","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"凛と真音からリリースバトルの開催が発表され、PROTOSTAR、LEGIT、JAXX/JAXXはそれぞれリリースライブのモチーフを何にするかを話し合っていた。 LEGITはいつものように大毅と瑛士郎が方向性の違いで揉めていたが、無意識のうちに放った楓雅のある一言によりモチーフの方向性が定まる。 楓雅は自分が初めてグループに貢献できていると感じていたが、モチーフの参考のために自分自身を振り返っているとあることに気付く。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a8FGTCB1n0Wn2ykmOSyj5LDbhNr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a8FGTCB1n0Wn2ykmOSyj5LDbhNr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/2"},{"id":"5918807","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Fuga asks to change the motif for the Release Battle and for some reason, he's also avoiding Daiki and Eishiro.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-01-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d8P8bagPm6Ht11qI9jKhVJWvDMF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/d8P8bagPm6Ht11qI9jKhVJWvDMF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"5940057","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"LEGITのライブが終わっても、PROTOSTARはまだリリースバトルのモチーフを決められずにいた。 そんな時、万里のもとに地元・島根の地域PRイベントへの出演依頼が届く。 身内からきた相談ということもありどうしたらいいか迷っている万里に、3人にとっても”いい機会だ”と送り出す凛と真音。 準備万端で挑んだイベント会場に広がっていたのは3人が想像していたものとは違う景色で……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/srrKJ1aUQLDysqbXQL9QwToSD6O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/srrKJ1aUQLDysqbXQL9QwToSD6O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"5955818","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"アメリカで開催されるジャズライブへの出演オファーがあった楽翔。海外でも自分らしく活動をこなす楽翔とは裏腹に、ほまれ、一澄、潤、奏太の4人はなぜか仕事で思うように動けずにいた。 楽翔の存在の大きさを改めて自覚した4人だったが、楽翔がいない分を補うため、さらに力を入れて活動に励むように。 そんな中、JAXX/JAXXが5人揃って参加する「生バズバラエティ」のダンス企画の撮影が迫り、全員で頑張ろうと意気込んでいた4人のもとに、凛からあることを知らされる──。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/btxsTKgRRZ9oYq7Dz1iQ6CP7SCE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/btxsTKgRRZ9oYq7Dz1iQ6CP7SCE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"5969905","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ほまれ、一澄、潤、奏太の4人で挑んだ「生バズバラエティ」は、本人たちの想像を大きく超えた盛り上がりを見せた。 バズったことを嬉しく思いつつも、楽翔が複雑な気持ちを抱えているのではないかと気にかける奏太。 そんな奏太に対して潤は、ある日を境になぜかいたずらを仕掛けるように。奏太はその理由に心当たりがない様子だが、どうやら潤は奏太に気が付いてほしいことがあるようで……?!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fEdHemiy72TGsqrJUPV4Syul4IS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fEdHemiy72TGsqrJUPV4Syul4IS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/6"},{"id":"5982454","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"リリースライブもついにPROTOSTARを残すのみとなっていた。LEGITとJAXX/JAXXの集計結果を見ながら、PROTOSTARがどんなライブを見せてくれるのかを話す凛と真音は、sMiLeaプロダクションを発足した当時では考えられなかったことだと振り返る。伝説のアイドルからプロデューサーへの転身で起こった知られざる過去が明らかに。 一方で明良を中心とした所属アイドルたちは、凛、真音、晴美に隠れてなにやら不穏な動きを見せていて……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-02-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zYdxWeuw1iSe5RF4IrbbXAqzCsK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zYdxWeuw1iSe5RF4IrbbXAqzCsK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/7"},{"id":"5982455","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"PROTOSTARは次なる巡業先である「ランタン祭り」のために準備を進めていた。 昔は地元の人に愛されていた祭りだったが、あることをきっかけに祭りのあり方が変わってしまっていた。 変わってしまった祭りに対して距離を感じている地元の人を、万里と千紘は自身のファンと重ね合わせて見るように。 祭りに参加する全員が笑顔になる方法を探していたPROTOSTARが出した結論とは……?!","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86bKyB41fjkdjlVYuQTx0w3F7kl.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/86bKyB41fjkdjlVYuQTx0w3F7kl.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/8"},{"id":"5982456","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「ランタン祭り」での経験を経て、ついにリリースバトルのモチーフが決まったPROTOSTAR。 それぞれのユニットが自分自身やメンバーと向き合い、想いを込めて作り上げたリリースバトルのステージで、最高の輝きを見せたのは一体どのユニットなのか。 凛と真音がリリースバトルを通じて3組に伝えたかったこととは――。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wVjXMzFgVHbzHHgR4A9zt2PGL2p.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wVjXMzFgVHbzHHgR4A9zt2PGL2p.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/9"},{"id":"5982457","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The sMiLea Production idols are suddenly sent to an overnight training camp by Lin and Maoto. Although they're enjoying their stay by having snowball fights and doing other activities, PROTOSTAR began feeling overwhelmed by the responsibility and pressure of leading the joint live performance.\n\nWhen Daiki sees the three members of PROTOSTAR lack the confidence to direct the senior groups, LEGIT and JAXX/JAXX, he begins venting about his frustrations.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-03-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lasxnN7mrmEsIe3GoOyJYtIjlC3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lasxnN7mrmEsIe3GoOyJYtIjlC3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/10"},{"id":"5982458","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"PROTOSTAR, LEGIT, and JAXX/JAXX form a deeper bond with the overnight training camp. As they work on improving for the joint performance, Akira strangely shows up late to practice. Banri and Chihiro are worried about Akira, who isn't acting like himself. They head to Kikunoyu Hot Springs to talk to him when they realize Akira's mother isn't there. After wondering if there is any way they can support Akira, what will Banri and Chihiro do?!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-04-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cB1VNQg5PPCWYkwkuGlh12zrEqs.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cB1VNQg5PPCWYkwkuGlh12zrEqs.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/11"},{"id":"5982459","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the help of all the idols at sMiLea Production, Akira is able to perform at the joint concert.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2025-04-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/grUGIMBd7N8EppqMpHotYE4MR6s.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/grUGIMBd7N8EppqMpHotYE4MR6s.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2/episode/12"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/210899/season/2"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"7":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"8":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"9":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"10":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"11":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"},"12":{"checkedAt":1793370190822,"status":"ok"}}}
